---
import { APP_URL } from '../config';
---
<section id="offline">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">./install --offline</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Install it. Then unplug the internet.</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
      crashDot is a Progressive Web App — add it to your phone or desktop like a
      native app, and once it's loaded it boots and plays with <b>no connection at
      all</b>. Perfect for a gig on a dodgy venue Wi‑Fi, or a plane.
    </p>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step bracket">
        <span class="step-n">1</span>
        <h3>Open it</h3>
        <p>Visit crashDot once, online, in Chrome, Edge or your phone's browser. That first load caches the whole engine.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={APP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open crashDot ▸</a>
      </li>
      <li class="step bracket">
        <span class="step-n">2</span>
        <h3>Install</h3>
        <p><b>Desktop</b> — Chrome/Edge: click <b>⬇ install</b> in crashDot's toolbar, or the install icon (⊕) at the right of the address bar.<br /><b>iPhone / iPad</b> — <b>Share → Add to Home Screen</b>.<br />One click — no store, no account.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step bracket">
        <span class="step-n">3</span>
        <h3>Go offline</h3>
        <p>It's now an app on your home screen / dock. Launch it with the Wi‑Fi off — boot, write patterns, play. Everything works.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="offline-note">
      <b>Samples too:</b> load the sample kit once while online and it's cached — your
      drums come with you offline. Only live multiplayer &amp; the shared galaxy need a
      connection; solo coding never does.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #offline { }
  .steps { list-style: none; margin: 30px 0 20px; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; counter-reset: none; }
  .step { padding: 22px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; position: relative; }
  .step-n {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green-dim); border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
    color: var(--green); font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px;
  }
  .step h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-1); }
  .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; flex: 1; }
  .step .btn { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 4px; }
  .offline-note {
    margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 14px 18px; border-left: 2px solid var(--green);
    background: var(--bg-2); color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
  }
  .offline-note b { color: var(--text-1); }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
